+@deffn Command target_poll_interval [milliseconds]
+Set or show how often the targets are polled in the background
+(default 100 ms). A shorter interval notices sooner that a target
+halted, at the cost of more adapter traffic while it runs. The server
+loop sleeps up to @command{poll_period} ms between polls, so set that
+no longer than this.
